# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PACE / CAPITAL — repository ignore rules
# The repo ships the SOFTWARE (launchers, program, blank master templates, docs).
# Large binaries and private data are deliberately excluded — see notes below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Bundled emulator (110 MB) — distributed via GitHub Releases, not in-tree.
#    The launchers fall back to a system DOSBox-X, or you unzip a release asset
#    into emu/.  See README "Other platforms".
emu/

# ── User manual (51 MB of RTF + viewer) — distributed via GitHub Releases.
eMANUAL/

# ── PRIVATE CLIENT DATA — real co-operative-society financial records
#    (member ledgers, transactions, bills). NEVER publish. The repo ships only
#    the blank master templates in PACE/ ; real society folders are excluded.
#    Society data folders are named with a numeric code + a high byte (e.g. 01»).
PACE/[0-9][0-9]*/
PACE/*»*/

# ── Archived vendor/installer tooling (old DOS installers, licence tooling,
#    the later Windows product). Not part of the runnable app.
attic/

# ── macOS / editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db

# ── Emulator runtime leftovers
*.tmp
*.TMP
pace-*.conf
caps/

# ── Local build/screenshot/scratch output
*.png
*.zip
*.arj
SUMMARY_overview_backup.md

# ── Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
